## Key takeaways

| Bug | Typical JS cause | Common fix |
|---|---|---|
| Race condition | `await` between read and write of shared state | Synchronous update, mutex, or atomic ops (`Atomics`) |
| Deadlock | Locks acquired in inconsistent order; circular awaits | Global lock ordering, combined lock, timeouts, avoid nested locks |
| Livelock/starvation | Busy‑waiting without backoff | `Atomics.wait`, exponential backoff, fair queues |

