| Technique | When to use |
|---|---|
| `console.log/info/warn/error/debug` | Quick, level-filtered output |
| `console.table` | Arrays/objects of records |
| `console.time/timeEnd` | Simple timing |
| `performance.now/mark/measure` | Precise profiling |
| `debugger;` | Hard breakpoints in source |
| `try/catch/finally` + `cause` | Error context without losing root cause |
| `Error.captureStackTrace` | Clean stacks in library code |
| `process.on('unhandledRejection', ...)` | Catch async mistakes |
