## Short Worked Example

```js
let node = { value: 1 };
const weak = new WeakRef(node);

console.log(weak.deref()?.value); // 1

node = null; // remove strong reference

// At some later point, possibly after GC:
// weak.deref() may return undefined
setTimeout(() => {
  console.log(weak.deref()); // often undefined, but not guaranteed immediately
}, 1000);
```

